Z||000000||RedGTFieroKCMO||12-05-2001||10:08 PM||||Will backlit GT gauges fit into an 85 GT interchangeably? What years had the true backlit needle and faces?<P>Last, will the GT pod over the vent console plug in to the 85 GT??  Is the wiring there for this??<P>Thanks!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||5
Z||000001||FieroPerformance||12-05-2001||10:11 PM||||Yeah, they are plug and play. The backlit gauges are in the 86+ GTs, I am not sure if they are in any of the other ones. You can hook up the aux. (oil pressure and voltage) gauges up, but I am not sure of the wireing.<P>It is a great upgrade. I love the backlighting!<P>-Charlie<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsigfperformance.jpg"> ||||reg||1
